nit: add this line behind "pm_nl_add_endpoint $ns1 10.0.2.1 flags
signal". Usually, set n1 first and then n2.

>  		pm_nl_add_endpoint $ns1 10.0.2.1 flags signal
>  		fullmesh=1 speed=slow \
>  			run_tests $ns1 $ns2 10.0.1.1
